# counter harness. One force call is one ASE calculate inside the solid-state dimer.
# rotationOpt is bfgs. rotationMax is the 10000-call cap.
# maxStep, dR, and phi_tol stay at the SSDimer constructor defaults.
# The geometry stays fixed. One get_forces runs the rotation.
# The run ends when that rotation returns. Overlap >= 0.99 is a success.
# A finished rotation under the overlap is a wrong-mode failure.
# TSASE forceCalls is not this count.
